{"id":"61b740fdfd46bce6","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-solved-form-mgu.md","title":"求解形式给出幂等MGU","display":"thm-solved-form-mgu — 求解形式给出幂等MGU","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-solved-form-mgu","aliases":["56-thm-solved-form-mgu"],"display":"thm-solved-form-mgu — 求解形式给出幂等MGU","depends_on":["[[56-df-unification-problem]]","[[56-df-substitution]]","[[56-df-substitution-composition]]","[[56-df-solved-unification-problem]]","[[56-df-idempotent-substitution]]","[[56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion]]"],"source_section":"§7.7 proof of Theorem 7.7.6","source_printed_pages":"294","source_ocr_blocks":[315],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-solved-form-mgu"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-solved-form-mgu</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solved-form-mgu — 求解形式给出幂等MGU"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6228082765353868\" href=\"?note=6228082765353868\" title=\"56-df-substitution\">56-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0df0123405bbc66d\" href=\"?note=0df0123405bbc66d\" title=\"56-df-substitution-composition\">56-df-substitution-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d1733562c097db66\" href=\"?note=d1733562c097db66\" title=\"56-df-solved-unification-problem\">56-df-solved-unification-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"94e07ab4a04b0626\" href=\"?note=94e07ab4a04b0626\" title=\"56-df-idempotent-substitution\">56-df-idempotent-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e01b783dda59f5e\" href=\"?note=4e01b783dda59f5e\" title=\"56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion\">56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.7 proof of Theorem 7.7.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"294"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>315</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal G\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal G\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Solved}(E)\">\\(\\operatorname{Solved}(E)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_E,S,\\operatorname{Sol},\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}\">\\(\\sigma_E,S,\\operatorname{Sol},\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d1733562c097db66\" href=\"?note=d1733562c097db66\" title=\"56-df-solved-unification-problem\">56-df-solved-unification-problem</a>，幂等性及支持判据见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"94e07ab4a04b0626\" href=\"?note=94e07ab4a04b0626\" title=\"56-df-idempotent-substitution\">56-df-idempotent-substitution</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4e01b783dda59f5e\" href=\"?note=4e01b783dda59f5e\" title=\"56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion\">56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_E\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma_E\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Idempotent}(\\sigma_E)\\land\\sigma_E\\in\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}(E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Idempotent}(\\sigma_E)\\land\\sigma_E\\in\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}(E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sol}(E)=\\{\\sigma_E\\circ\\rho\\mid\\rho\\in S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sol}(E)=\\{\\sigma_E\\circ\\rho\\mid\\rho\\in S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限E给出有限支持；求解形式使支持与引入变量不交，故幂等。对任意ρ，右项不含左变量，所以σ_Eρ满足每个x=t。反之τ满足E时，对左变量有(σ_Eτ)(x)=tτ=τ(x)，对其余变量有(σ_Eτ)(x)=τ(x)，于是全局τ=σ_Eτ。取ρ=τ即给MGU因子化。此为原书定理7.7.6证明中使用事实的独立本地展开。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-unification-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"6228082765353868","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"0df0123405bbc66d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-solved-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"